# A literal, not a counter: Task 1 implements only PUSH_LIT/PRINTF/END, and
# `counter`/`inc` compile to opcodes (LOAD_COUNTER/ADD/STORE_COUNTER) Task 3
# adds. This still catches a dispatch bug -- firing zero or twice would change
# the line count against the single-line baseline -- without depending on
# opcodes this task doesn't implement. Task 2 (arith.probe) is where counters
# return to this test suite.
probe reset() {
  printf("reset %u\n", 1)
}

install reset at $FA62
